# Optional. stabbur's primary config is `stabbur.toml` (see stabbur.toml.example or run
# `stabbur init`). You normally do NOT need a .env.
#
# Use this only for per-machine overrides of stabbur.toml, or for secrets you'd
# rather keep out of a committed file. A STABBUR_* env var (including one set here)
# overrides stabbur.toml's top-level keys.

# Override the library location for this machine (e.g. a different mount on Linux).
# STABBUR_LIBRARY_ROOT=/mnt/llm/Library

# Hugging Face token for gated/private repos (falls back to `hf login`).
# STABBUR_HF_TOKEN=hf_...
